# Coding Standards
- Follow the repository's existing coding conventions and style.
- Keep changes minimal and scoped; do not modify unrelated files.

# Financial Services Rules
- Monetary values must use BigDecimal (or Decimal).
- Never use float or double for monetary values.
- Round monetary values to 2 decimal places with RoundingMode.HALF_UP.

# Definition of Done
- Every public function must have a docstring.
- Every public function must have at least one test.
- Run the test suite (mvn test) and confirm all tests pass before completing.